        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
        "excerpt": "Amy Coney Barrett, Associate Justice, was born in New Orleans, Louisiana, on January 28, 1972. She received a B.A. from Rhodes College in 1994 and a J.D. from Notre Dame Law School in 1997. She took her seat on October 27, 2020.",
        "tier": 1
      },
